## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `cargo test` — unit tests for formula in `calculation.rs`:
  - Test with known snow/wind loads and material angles
  - Test with `None` loads → midpoint result
  - Test boundary conditions (result clamped to min/max)

### Manual Verification
- `cargo run` — confirm server starts on configured port
- Send a POST request via `curl` to the `/api/roof_angle_calculation/1/finish` endpoint and verify 200 response
